<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Union Real Estate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Union Real Estate.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it started coverage of First Union Real Estate Investments and added the stock to the firm's recommended list.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 1/8 to 10-3/4.</p>
</text>
